      "post_stream": {
        "posts": [
          {
            "id": 610316,
            "name": "Jayden Adamson",
            "username": "Jayden_Adamson",
            "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/community.n8n.io/jayden_adamson/{size}/196097_2.png",
            "created_at": "2026-11-06T16:56:52.825Z",
            "cooked": "<p>Hey everyone!</p>\n<p>We’re looking for an experienced <strong>Automation Engineer</strong> to join our team full-time at <strong>Ecom Consulting</strong>, a growing high-ticket consulting company.</p>\n<p>We’re not looking for a freelancer or someone to complete a one-time project. We’re looking for a long-term team member who can take ownership of our CRM, automation infrastructure, and server-side tracking systems.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"p-610316-position-details-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-610316-position-details-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Position Details</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Compensation:</strong> $2,000–$3,000 USD/month (depending on experience)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Employment:</strong> Full-time, 40 hours/week</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Location:</strong> Remote (LATAM preferred, open to global applicants)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Schedule:</strong> Monday–Friday, with overlap during US Eastern business hours</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><a name=\"p-610316-what-youll-be-responsible-for-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-610316-what-youll-be-responsible-for-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>What You’ll Be Responsible For</h3>\n<p><strong>1. Close CRM Management &amp; Automation</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Build, maintain, and optimize advanced workflows within Close CRM.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Develop integrations using the Close API and webhooks.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Automate lead routing, pipeline management, follow-ups, and sales processes.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Troubleshoot CRM issues and improve data accuracy.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Connect Close with our existing sales and marketing tools.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. n8n Workflow Development</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Design and deploy complex n8n automations.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Build custom API integrations and webhook-based workflows.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Implement error handling, logging, and automated retries.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Maintain and optimize existing automations.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Develop AI-powered workflows where applicable.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. Server-Side Tracking &amp; Attribution</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Implement and maintain Meta Conversions API (CAPI).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Configure server-side tracking through Google Tag Manager.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Manage event deduplication and conversion tracking.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Connect CRM conversion events with advertising platforms.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Troubleshoot tracking discrepancies and attribution issues.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. Sales &amp; Marketing Infrastructure</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Integrate lead generation systems with Close CRM.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Automate appointment booking, reminders, and follow-ups.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Build reporting workflows for sales and marketing performance.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Improve overall operational efficiency through automation.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><a name=\"p-610316-required-qualifications-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-610316-required-qualifications-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Required Qualifications</h3>\n<p>We’re specifically looking for someone with:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/white_check_mark.png?v=16\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Proven experience working with <strong>Close CRM</strong> (required).</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/white_check_mark.png?v=16\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Advanced experience building production workflows in <strong>n8n</strong>.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/white_check_mark.png?v=16\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Strong understanding of REST APIs, webhooks, and JSON.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/white_check_mark.png?v=16\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Experience with JavaScript for custom integrations.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/white_check_mark.png?v=16\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Hands-on experience with Meta CAPI and server-side tracking.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/white_check_mark.png?v=16\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Experience integrating CRMs with marketing and sales platforms.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/white_check_mark.png?v=16\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Strong troubleshooting and problem-solving skills.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/white_check_mark.png?v=16\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Ability to work independently and take ownership of projects.</p>\n<p><strong>Please do not apply if you have never worked with Close CRM.</strong> This is a core requirement for the position.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"p-610316-what-were-looking-for-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-610316-what-were-looking-for-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>What We’re Looking For</h3>\n<p>We want someone who can do more than simply connect applications.</p>\n<p>You should be comfortable designing automation systems from scratch, identifying inefficiencies, troubleshooting technical issues, and proactively improving our infrastructure.</p>\n<p>Ideally, you’ve previously worked with high-ticket sales organizations, marketing agencies, or businesses running paid advertising.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"p-610316-how-to-apply-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-610316-how-to-apply-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>How to Apply</h3>\n<p>Please complete the application below:</p>\n<p><strong>Application:</strong> <a href=\"https://form.typeform.com/to/TcG6wfGj\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">We're hiring a AI Automation Engineer 🤖</a></p>\n<p>In your application, please highlight:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Your previous experience with Close CRM.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Examples of complex n8n workflows you’ve built.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Your experience with Meta CAPI and server-side tracking.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Your current location and expected monthly compensation.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>We’re looking to hire as soon as we find the right person.</p>\n<p>Looking forward to connecting with some talented engineers here!</p>\n<p><small><img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twemoji/information_source.png?v=16\" title=\":information_source:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":information_source:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Replies are closed - contact the author using email, application form or direct message. Read more <a href=\"https://community.n8n.io/t/jobs-category-guidelines-posting-and-applying/941\">here</a>.</small></p>",
